Anna: Sure! I''ve never seen a dragon boat race before. Where are they?
Mike: By the river near the city park. They start at nine in the morning.
Anna: Great. Should we bring anything?
Mike: Yes, let''s bring some zongzi to eat. My mum made a lot.
Anna: Yummy! How does a team win?
Mike: The fastest boat to the end wins. The drums help them row together.
Anna: Sounds exciting. Let''s meet at the park gate at half past eight.', 'Mike约Anna周六看龙舟赛;赛在城市公园旁的河上、上午九点开始;带Mike妈妈做的粽子;最快到终点的队获胜,鼓声帮助齐桨;约八点半在公园门口见。', 'us_male', '[{"q": "When is the Dragon Boat Festival?", "type": "choice", "answer": "D", "options": ["Next Sunday.", "This Friday.", "Next month.", "This Saturday."]}, {"q": "Where are the races held?", "type": "choice", "answer": "C", "options": ["At the school.", "In the city square.", "By the river near the city park.", "On the lake in the mountains."]}, {"q": "What will they bring to eat?", "type": "choice", "answer": "C", "options": ["Mooncakes.", "Dumplings.", "Zongzi.", "Turkey."]}, {"q": "How does a team win the race?", "type": "choice", "answer": "C", "options": ["It has the biggest boat.", "It sings the loudest.", "Its boat reaches the end fastest.", "It has the most people."]}, {"q": "When will they meet?", "type": "choice", "answer": "D", "options": ["At nine at the river.", "At eight at school.", "At ten at the park.", "At half past eight at the park gate."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'g9', 'U2');
Mei: The Mid-Autumn Festival. It''s next week.
Sam: I''m from Australia, so I don''t know much about it. What do people do?
Mei: Families get together and look at the full moon. We also eat mooncakes.
Sam: Mooncakes? What are they like?
Mei: They''re round cakes with sweet fillings, like nuts or red beans.
Sam: That sounds nice. Why do you look at the moon?
Mei: A round moon means the family is together. Would you like to join my family this year?
Sam: I''d love to. Thank you!', 'Sam问梅快到什么节日;梅:下周中秋节。Sam来自澳大利亚不太了解;梅:家人团聚、赏满月、吃月饼;月饼是带坚果或红豆等甜馅的圆饼;圆月象征团圆;梅邀Sam今年加入她家,Sam欣然答应。', 'us_male', '[{"q": "What festival is coming soon?", "type": "choice", "answer": "C", "options": ["The Spring Festival.", "Christmas.", "The Mid-Autumn Festival.", "Halloween."]}, {"q": "Where is Sam from?", "type": "choice", "answer": "A", "options": ["Australia.", "Canada.", "England.", "America."]}, {"q": "What do families do on this festival?", "type": "choice", "answer": "A", "options": ["Get together and look at the full moon.", "Throw water at each other.", "Watch boat races.", "Make lanterns."]}, {"q": "What is inside mooncakes?", "type": "choice", "answer": "B", "options": ["Meat and salt.", "Sweet fillings like nuts or red beans.", "Rice and leaves.", "Cheese and ham."]}, {"q": "What does Mei invite Sam to do?", "type": "choice", "answer": "A", "options": ["Join her family.", "Visit Australia.", "Buy mooncakes.", "Write a letter."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'g9', 'U2');
Ben: I think Spring Festival is the best. I love the dumplings and the red packets.
Lily: Me too, but I also like the Mid-Autumn Festival.
Ben: Why is that?
Lily: Because I can eat mooncakes and look at the beautiful moon with my family.
Ben: That''s nice. What about a festival from another country?
Lily: I''d like to try Christmas one day. I want to see a real Christmas tree.
Ben: I''d like to see Halloween. Wearing scary costumes looks fun!
Lily: Haha, you would make a great ghost!', 'Lily问Ben最爱的节日;Ben:春节最好,爱饺子和红包;Lily也喜欢春节,还喜欢中秋(能和家人吃月饼赏月);谈到外国节日,Lily想体验圣诞看真圣诞树,Ben想看万圣节、觉得穿吓人服装好玩;Lily打趣他会是个好“鬼”。', 'us_female', '[{"q": "What is Ben''s favourite festival?", "type": "choice", "answer": "A", "options": ["Spring Festival.", "The Mid-Autumn Festival.", "Christmas.", "Halloween."]}, {"q": "Why does Lily like the Mid-Autumn Festival?", "type": "choice", "answer": "D", "options": ["She gets red packets.", "She watches races.", "She throws water.", "She can eat mooncakes and look at the moon with family."]}, {"q": "Which foreign festival would Lily like to try?", "type": "choice", "answer": "C", "options": ["Halloween.", "Thanksgiving.", "Christmas.", "The Water Festival."]}, {"q": "What does Ben want to see?", "type": "choice", "answer": "A", "options": ["Halloween.", "A dragon boat race.", "A lantern show.", "A Christmas tree."]}, {"q": "Why does Ben like Halloween?", "type": "choice", "answer": "A", "options": ["Wearing scary costumes looks fun.", "He likes the food.", "He likes the moon.", "He likes red packets."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'g9', 'U2');

